	(descr "SR25-style 6-position 2-pole galette rotary, panel mount. All dimensions from the calipered FreeCAD model 3d/SR25.step: bushing 8.62mm x 7.00mm usable (hole 8.8mm), shaft 6.00mm, body 25.00mm, 12 taps on D19.99 at exactly 30deg + 2 wiper commons on D10.90. F.Fab circle is the body keepout BEHIND the panel. User.1 shows the lug ring for reference only - the lugs sit 11.3mm behind this board and cannot land on it.")
